  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "Let $R=PQ.$ What is the value of ${r}_{25}$, if\n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & -8 \\\\ 3 & -9\\end{aligned}],\\,Q=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 & -1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -2 & 7\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row of $P$ by the $5$th column of $Q$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{25} & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & -8 \\\\ 3 & -9\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 & -1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -2 & 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =3\\cdot 10+(-4)\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =30-28 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
